OL,3,ANvidia boss says AI 'doesn't need new
OL,4,Alaws' as safety concerns grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe heads of artificial intelligence
OL,7,F(AI) firms should decide if new
OL,8,Fversions of the technology should be
OL,9,Freleased, Nvidia boss Jensen Huang has
OL,10,Fsaid in response to growing concerns
OL,11,Fabout AI's threat to humans.
OL,13,F"We don't need new laws or
OL,14,Fregulations," Huang said, adding that
OL,15,Fthere should not be a "false choice"
OL,16,Fbetween the speed of innovation and the
OL,17,Fsafety of AI products.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
